                    <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Protocol of Signature</hi></p>
                    <p>The Treaties, Conventions, Agreements, Protocol and Declarations of even date
                        may be signed until midday on September 13, 1919.</p>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Done</hi> at Saint-Germain-en-Laye, the tenth day
                        of September one thousand nine hundred and nineteen.</p>
